# Coordinator source and receipt review

Reviewed canonical IDs, iterative SCC condensation, DAG longest-path ranks, measured extents and weak-component separation. Independent closure/property tests cover all512 three-node graphs in two directions plus numeric/budget/cancellation constraints. First capture passed all15 tests and failed only test-loop clippy lints; corrected tests pass the final fmt/test/clippy capture with production bytes unchanged. The algorithm is a proposed Rust layout with explicit ELK differences, not verified original layout parity. Logical work/storage accounting is not CPU/RSS admission.

The coordinator is distinct from the implementation worker and also executed the captures. No second runtime executor or complete-area parity claim is made. See VALIDATION.json for final results and original evidence.
